---

<ToolLayout
  lang={lang}
  toolId="coordinate-converter"
  title={c.title}
  description={c.description}
  h1={c.h1}
  subtitle={c.subtitle}
>
  <div class="tool-interface">
    <label class="label">{c.labelInput}</label>
    <div class="input-group" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
      <input type="text" class="input" id="cc-input" placeholder={c.placeholder} />
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="cc-btn" type="button">{c.btnConvert}</button>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" id="cc-gps" type="button" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">{c.btnGps}</button>
    <div class="tool-result" id="cc-result" style="display: none;">
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblDd}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-dd" style="color: var(--color-accent-primary);">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblDmsLat}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-dms-lat">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblDmsLng}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-dms-lng">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblUtm}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-utm">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">MGRS (Military Grid)</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-mgrs" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600;">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblGeohash}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-geohash">—</span></div>
      <div class="tool-result-row"><span class="tool-result-label">{c.lblPlusCode}</span><span class="tool-result-value" id="cc-pluscode">—</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
    <h2>{c.h2Formats}</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>{c.fmt1}</li>
      <li>{c.fmt2}</li>
      <li>{c.fmt3}</li>
      <li><strong>MGRS (Military Grid Reference System)</strong> — NATO military standard grid based on UTM projection</li>
      <li>{c.fmt4}</li>
      <li>{c.fmt5}</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4); line-height: 1.8;">
      <a href={getLocalizedPath('/comparisons/decimal-degrees-vs-dms/', lang)} style="color: var(--color-accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">{c.compLinkText} →</a>
    </p>

    <h2>{lang === 'es' ? 'Escala de Precisión en Grados Decimales' : lang === 'fr' ? 'Échelle de Précision des Degrés Décimaux' : lang === 'de' ? 'Präzisionsstufen von Dezimalgraden' : lang === 'pt' ? 'Escala de Precisão de Graus Decimais' : lang === 'hi' ? 'दशमलव डिग्री सटीकता पैमाना' : lang === 'id' ? 'Skala Presisi Derajat Desimal' : 'Decimal Degrees Precision Scale'}</h2>
    <p>{lang === 'es' ? 'Cada posición decimal proporciona un nivel de resolución específico: 1 decimal identifica una ciudad o región (~11,1 km); 2 decimales un pueblo (~1,1 km); 3 decimales un barrio (~111 m); 4 decimales una parcela o calle (~11 m); 5 decimales un árbol o entrada (~1,1 m); y 6 decimales identifica una baldosa o centímetro (~0,11 m).' : lang === 'fr' ? 'Chaque décimale affine la précision spatiale : 1 décimale couvre une région (~11 km), 2 décimales un village (~1,1 km), 3 décimales un quartier (~111 m), 4 décimales une parcelle (~11 m), 5 décimales un seuil de porte (~1,1 m) et 6 décimales descendent à l\'échelle du centimètre (~11 cm).' : lang === 'de' ? 'Jede Nachkommastelle verfeinert die Ortsauflösung: 1 Stelle entspricht einer Großregion (~11 km), 2 Stellen einer Ortschaft (~1,1 km), 3 Stellen einem Stadtteil (~111 m), 4 Stellen einem Grundstück (~11 m), 5 Stellen einem Hauseingang (~1,1 m) und 6 Stellen lösen zentimetergenau (~11 cm) auf.' : lang === 'pt' ? 'Cada casa decimal amplia o nível de detalhe espacial: 1 casa cobre um município (~11 km), 2 casas uma vila (~1,1 km), 3 casas uma rua (~111 m), 4 casas um lote (~11 m), 5 casas a porta de entrada (~1,1 m) e 6 casas atingem precisão de 11 centímetros.' : lang === 'hi' ? 'प्रत्येक दशमलव स्थान सटीकता बढ़ाता है: 1 दशमलव स्थान ~11 किमी, 2 स्थान ~1.1 किमी, 3 स्थान ~111 मीटर, 4 स्थान ~11 मीटर, 5 स्थान ~1.1 मीटर और 6 स्थान 11 सेंटीमीटर तक की सूक्ष्म दूरी पहचानते हैं।' : lang === 'id' ? 'Tiap angka desimal memperinci resolusi spasial: 1 desimal mencakup wilayah kota (~11 km), 2 desimal desa (~1,1 km), 3 desimal jalan (~111 m), 4 desimal persil tanah (~11 m), 5 desimal pintu gedung (~1,1 m), dan 6 desimal mencapai skala 11 sentimeter.' : 'Each decimal place refines spatial resolution: 1 decimal place spans an entire city or large district (~11.1 km); 2 decimal places isolates a town (~1.1 km); 3 decimal places identifies a neighborhood street (~111 m); 4 decimal places resolves an individual parcel (~11 m); 5 decimal places pinpoints a doorway (~1.1 m); and 6 decimal places resolves down to individual centimeters (~0.11 m).'}</p>

    <div class="callout-box" style="margin-top: var(--space-6); line-height: 1.8;">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm);">
